      "writtenOn": "2022-04-22T14:31:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t tested on device that not support OPP.\nYour concern is right, we shouldn\u0027t enable these components on device that not support OPP.\nI modified this patch as do not disable BluetoothOppLauncherActivity when BT disable.\nAfter user flash ROM, the Bluetooth is default enabled, so this works fine on devices that support OPP. The only corner case is that when user disable BT and reboot device, the optional will not show until user turn on BT, but I think it is acceptable.\nThanks!",
