      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ahhh, well I think we should definitely test on a device that doesn\u0027t support OPP and make sure you still don\u0027t the Bluetooth Sharing setting, etc. You can also just turn off profile support on a device that does support it to see what happens.\n\nI think simply removing code from the stop() call may work, but it\u0027s a bit hacky. We should probably get Roopa/Rahul\u0027s opinion to see if a more formal mechanism might be desirable. I\u0027ll speak with Rahul on it early next week.",
